Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "Électronique",
    "description": "Produits électroniques"
}

POST http://localhost:3003/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "Vêtements",
    "description": "Mode et accessoires"
}

### Products
GET http://localhost:3003/products

GET http://localhost:3003/products?category=1&minPrice=10&page=1&limit=5

GET http://localhost:3003/products/1

POST http://localhost:3003/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "Smartphone XYZ",
    "description": "Dernier modèle",
    "prix": 599.99,
    "stock": 50,
    "categoryId": 1
}

POST http://localhost:3003/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "T-Shirt Noir",
    "description": "100% coton",
    "prix": 19.99,
    "stock": 100,
    "categoryId": 2
}

PUT http://localhost:3003/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "Smartphone XYZ Pro",
    "prix": 699.99,
    "stock": 45,
    "categoryId": 1
}

### Orders - Lister toutes les commandes
GET http://localhost:3003/orders

### Orders - Créer une commande
POST http://localhost:3003/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": 1,
    "items": [
        {"productId": 1, "quantite": 2},
        {"productId": 2, "quantite": 3}
    ]
}

### Orders - Voir une commande spécifique
GET http://localhost:3003/orders/1

### Orders - Changer le statut
PATCH http://localhost:3003/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

PATCH http://localhost:3003/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "SHIPPED"
}

### Stats
GET http://localhost:3003/orders/stats/all